sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant A as NestJS API
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Optional Redis cache
    participant S as Stripe
    Note over U,S: Current implementation; no physical unlock or QR credential
    U->>A: POST /public/reservations/hold
    A->>P: Check active locker and overlapping reservations
    Note over A,P: Check and insert are separate; no overlap exclusion constraint
    A->>P: Create HOLD with expiresAt (10 minutes)
    A->>R: Invalidate availability cache
    A-->>U: Reservation with locker and expiresAt
    U->>A: POST /public/payments/create-intent (reservationId)
    A->>P: Validate HOLD and expiration
    A->>S: Create PaymentIntent with server-calculated amount
    A-->>U: PaymentIntent including client_secret
    U->>S: Confirm payment with Stripe Elements
    S->>A: POST /payments/webhook: payment_intent.succeeded
    A->>A: Verify signature against raw body
    A->>P: Check and record PaymentEvent
    Note over A,P: Event recording and confirmation are not one transaction
    A->>P: If status is HOLD, mark CONFIRMED
    Note over A,P: Webhook currently does not check hold expiresAt
    A->>R: Invalidate availability cache
    A-->>S: received
    Note over U,A: No server push or QR payload is returned to browser
    A->>P: Scheduled job expires stale HOLD rows every minute
    A->>R: Invalidate availability cache when rows changed
